cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this repository when using its formalization or mathematical proof."
type: software
title: "Small-energy regularity for stationary harmonic maps in Lean 4"
authors:
  - name: "SmallEnergyRegularityStationaryHarmonicMaps contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/BrookWW/SmallEnergyRegularityStationaryHarmonicMaps"
url: "https://github.com/BrookWW/SmallEnergyRegularityStationaryHarmonicMaps"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of quantitative interior small-energy regularity for
  stationary weakly harmonic maps into compact embedded C2 targets in every
  source dimension at least two, with the smooth-target corollary for the same
  representative. The package includes the geometric and analytic proof
  dependencies and an independent mathematical exposition.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - harmonic maps
  - stationary harmonic maps
  - small-energy regularity
